<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Pressure</Major>
    <Description>This is a very simple macro for the Game PRESSURE in roblox and it targets  the Hot potato modifier in modifier runs

hot potato modifier ; A bomb is strapped on you and you have to croutch and uncroutch to reset the timer

to croutch and uncroutch is easy But having to do it every 10 to15 seaconds in an average of 40 minute runs is simply tediouse and strains the finger and puts you at risk of entity elimination due to lose of momentum , this macro simply instantly croutches and uncroutches in a milliseacond reseting the Bomb with a SINGLE button stroke making it easier on the fingers and less likely to loose momentum during node entity chase </Description>
    <Comment>
idk what this part is for

https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 6 1
KeyUp 6 1
KeyDown 6 1
KeyUp 6 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>